1623	All three capabilities default inspection to `ExecutionInspection`, which accepts tree, DAG and walking runners. Its common fields are status, stop reason, pause request, kind, execution mode, in-flight callback count and buffered event count. Concrete tree/DAG runners explicitly expose `TreeDagExecutionInspection<Phase>`; walkers expose `GraphWalkInspection`. Generalizing inspection never widens supported phases or promises another family's detailed fields. Concrete builders implement their public contracts directly; sources implement `TreeSource` structurally. `TreeTraversalEvent` remains the tree event record.
